# Shylenai's owls in Darnassus.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, two owls; the new Eagle Owl; a beta
# sighting at 69.8,45.6); Forever's client data (ItemSparse prices; every pet
# item teaches its companion when used).

step Shylenai
  tip Shylenai, the owl trainer, stands on the Craftsmen's Terrace in Darnassus, beside the food and general goods vendors. She sells three owls (50s each); the Eagle Owl is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8665                         -- Shylenai
  buy 8500 npc 8665 optional          -- Great Horned Owl, 50s
  buy 8501 npc 8665 optional          -- Hawk Owl, 50s
  buy 280803 "Eagle Owl" npc 8665 optional -- 50s
